1
00:00:00,212 --> 00:00:04,152
(Howard:)Yeah. A grown man moving
into his own apartment.

2
00:00:04,149 --> 00:00:06,049
Crazy times. See ya!

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,650
(Bernadette:)Ignore him.

4
00:00:09,655 --> 00:00:11,855
He's just using humor
to express how...

5
00:00:11,857 --> 00:00:13,987
(Bernadette:)happy he is.

6
00:00:13,992 --> 00:00:16,392
(Stuart:)It's okay. I know he loves me.

7
00:00:16,395 --> 00:00:18,395
(Bernadette:)Sure he does.

8
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,663
(Bernadette:)Well, let us know
when you're all settled in.

9
00:00:23,669 --> 00:00:27,439
(Stuart:)I will. And I really can't
thank you guys enough.

10
00:00:27,439 --> 00:00:29,169
(engine starts)
Our pleasure.

11
00:00:29,174 --> 00:00:31,504
(Amy:)Bye.
Bye.

12
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:35,149
WOLOWITZ:
He's gone!

13
00:00:35,147 --> 00:00:37,677
Let's start in the garage!

14
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:49,540
(Raj:)Okay, so once we receive
the next image

15
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:51,470
(Raj:)and compare it to the ones
we've already collected,

16
00:00:51,476 --> 00:00:53,106
(Raj:)we'll know what it is
that we found.

17
00:00:53,111 --> 00:00:56,911
(Sheldon:)Ooh, perhaps it's a
Heliosheath scintillation.

18
00:00:56,914 --> 00:00:59,214
(Raj:)It could be
a trans-Neptunian object.

